  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "敌方行动完全预告，但手中只有四颗骰子，必须在移动逃生与攻击火力之间逐回合分配",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Perfect Information: Enemy actions are 100% telegraphed. Find the optimal ratio between movement and offense each turn. Desperate Resource Management: You hold only 4 dice.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4270800/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "卷轴会重新解释骰面，同一个“1”既可能是失败也可能被转化为暴击",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Rethinking Dice Values: Every scroll interprets numbers differently. A generic '1' could be a failure on one scroll, but a critical hit on another.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4270800/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗只能携带四张卷轴，要在射程、范围伤害、生存与冲击力之间压缩出一套小型构筑",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "4 Scrolls, Condensed Strategy: You can only bring 4 scrolls into battle. Find the perfect balance between range, AoE (Area of Effect), survival, and impact.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4270800/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
